{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I have always wanted to start my own business, ever since I was in high school.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/866d19ff7b67046163cf11aeea4e804bb2b1a91653713d4a06aea335b6165ae6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 2.02], [8, 2.02, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 3.06], [11, 3.06, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.36], [13, 3.36, 3.5], [14, 3.5, 3.64], [15, 3.64, 3.9]]}, {"text": "Since then, I have been struggling to find an idea that I am truly passionate enough to invest my time or resources to execute on my own.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b65fc4c7b7563bcf71073ed54d684a6482f4d3d359716500ceba094ce301e822.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.58], [4, 0.98, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.36], [10, 2.36, 2.56], [11, 2.56, 2.68], [12, 2.68, 2.78], [13, 2.78, 3.04], [14, 3.04, 3.5], [15, 3.5, 3.88], [16, 3.88, 4.1], [17, 4.1, 4.36], [18, 4.36, 4.66], [19, 4.66, 5.0], [20, 5.0, 5.26], [21, 5.26, 5.78], [22, 5.78, 6.16], [23, 6.16, 6.58], [24, 6.58, 6.84], [25, 6.84, 7.0], [26, 7.0, 7.24]]}, {"text": "So I decided I graduated from Georgia Tech in ‘11, I decided I should do the second best thing: work for someone that is starting their own business.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b729f309b1e6a70719ba1442ac2ccf02b04bee4f67ce59f8749250a77f346103.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.56], [9, 2.56, 3.26], [10, 3.84, 4.18], [11, 4.18, 4.5], [12, 4.5, 4.68], [13, 4.68, 4.86], [14, 4.86, 5.02], [15, 5.02, 5.16], [16, 5.16, 5.46], [17, 5.46, 5.78], [18, 5.78, 6.16], [19, 6.56, 6.66], [20, 6.66, 6.82], [21, 6.82, 7.12], [22, 7.12, 7.28], [23, 7.28, 7.38], [24, 7.38, 7.66], [25, 7.66, 7.9], [26, 7.9, 8.08], [27, 8.08, 8.44]]}, {"text": "This is a great technique because it reduces your risk (get paid a /mostly/ competitive salary) and gives you an opportunity to learn (make mistakes on someone else’s dollar :-))", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/156a8fd59548339b00db65cca96158a795e50b3397ee849f8614107e6942dce1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.62], [4, 0.62, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.68], [10, 3.0, 3.06], [11, 3.06, 3.28], [12, 3.28, 3.54], [14, 4.4, 4.92], [15, 4.92, 5.42], [16, 6.02, 6.12], [17, 6.12, 6.28], [18, 6.28, 6.46], [19, 6.46, 6.58], [20, 6.58, 7.0], [21, 7.0, 7.28], [22, 7.28, 7.56], [23, 8.0, 8.12], [24, 8.12, 8.46], [25, 8.46, 8.74], [26, 8.74, 9.08], [27, 9.08, 9.48], [28, 9.48, 9.74]]}, {"text": "While Atlanta has an awesome startup culture unless you are familiar with the big players (co-working spaces, syndications, meetup groups), it can be difficult finding what companies are hiring.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8fae59f88dfd4ecca95e2d12a45f3c533b86a817faf4cdc989e715d12d5a9201.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.38], [6, 1.74, 2.2], [7, 2.4, 2.56], [8, 2.56, 2.78], [9, 2.78, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.2], [11, 3.2, 3.54], [12, 3.54, 3.66], [13, 3.66, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.26], [16, 5.24, 5.7], [17, 6.24, 6.68], [19, 7.58, 7.88], [20, 8.26, 8.6], [21, 8.6, 8.72], [22, 8.72, 8.84], [23, 8.84, 9.24], [24, 9.24, 9.62], [25, 9.62, 9.86], [26, 9.86, 10.22], [27, 10.22, 10.42], [28, 10.42, 10.78]]}, {"text": "The Georgia Tech BuzzBoard only has postings by big name companies that can afford the hefty price tag.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e71c3b78a0ca4e8299a74c7ccd150fee3bcdaaa741aceb3005c21aab09703c47.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.64], [4, 1.1, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.32], [8, 2.32, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.52], [12, 3.52, 3.66], [13, 3.66, 3.96], [14, 3.96, 4.22], [15, 4.22, 4.6], [16, 4.6, 4.9], [17, 4.9, 5.14]]}, {"text": "Same can be said about the popular job board sites like CareerBuilder.com or Monster.com.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0e8e2dd78cac98c000bd1e14fa9b6f69f1fb55ba0feab2de426681a028c5c5e1.mp3"}, {"text": "Fast forward a few years and I finally figured out who to talk to and where to look for a startup job postings.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2d3423f3f3ecf22ff63788dc2b039fcb9219e62b00d6a4cc6796d5f6d39abf25.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.4], [7, 1.4, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.28], [10, 2.28, 2.5], [11, 2.5, 2.62], [12, 2.62, 2.84], [13, 2.84, 3.06], [14, 3.2, 3.3], [15, 3.3, 3.42], [16, 3.42, 3.54], [17, 3.54, 3.7], [18, 3.7, 3.9], [19, 3.9, 4.04], [20, 4.04, 4.32], [21, 4.32, 4.64], [22, 4.64, 5.3]]}, {"text": "But the experience was still frustrating because now I was checking 3-5 different job board websites for the various co-working and syndication websites.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/38fe2f27ca40fb402192c40c235d74e99e77135bf22029ca2cf474e9aa05d469.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.92], [12, 3.7, 4.0], [13, 4.0, 4.24], [14, 4.24, 4.46], [15, 4.46, 4.92], [16, 4.92, 5.18], [17, 5.18, 5.3], [18, 5.3, 5.66], [20, 6.18, 6.44], [21, 6.44, 6.9], [22, 6.9, 7.44]]}, {"text": "There was no one place to find these jobs.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5417ff5a78a171020061d41a93e2cd1db371237332a12c94daef120256ec6c38.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.48], [7, 1.48, 1.78], [8, 1.78, 2.06]]}, {"text": "So I made Atlanta Startup Jobs", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d96501230f88c108e8c1bac3dc058780c1a4c8ff2d4d14e1d66b85a48f89c968.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.76], [5, 1.76, 2.04]]}, {"text": "Atlanta Startup Jobs aggregates job postings from all of Atlanta’s job board websites automatically each night.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5f388ddf01f5b4b7e48bbab69909741b74ebaa19103c06156db491d83f33cea6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.14], [3, 1.14, 1.82], [4, 1.82, 2.06], [5, 2.06, 2.68], [6, 2.68, 2.88], [7, 2.88, 3.12], [8, 3.12, 3.26], [9, 3.26, 3.72], [12, 4.08, 4.52], [13, 4.52, 5.12], [14, 5.12, 5.6], [15, 5.6, 5.84]]}, {"text": "Then every Friday, it emails out to the subscriber list all of the jobs it found over the last week.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/228dcb5d683ae8afba852c183d53b0c55edbc8358f267669d815b4e086ccd276.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.86], [4, 1.12, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.78], [10, 2.78, 3.04], [12, 3.04, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.46], [15, 3.66, 3.94], [16, 3.94, 4.34], [17, 4.34, 4.48], [18, 4.48, 4.7], [19, 4.7, 5.04]]}, {"text": "The app is written in Ruby on Rails and hosted for free on Heroku.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1eb1da5a861148477eb1e032f3013b10ea2b05af4c76281fe99747da6f46e6a2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 0.88], [5, 0.88, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.36], [7, 1.36, 1.56], [8, 1.56, 1.88], [9, 1.88, 2.18], [10, 2.18, 2.38], [11, 2.38, 2.66], [12, 2.66, 2.84], [13, 2.84, 3.28]]}, {"text": "I use a separate application instance on Heroku (still free tier) to crawl the websites so the crawler gets its own set of dyno ours from the web application.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ca5c131b456f3ebd539f74eb2b0d8f491eaa591dedbd43321e26adbcaded3b00.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.84], [6, 1.84, 2.18], [7, 2.18, 2.62], [8, 3.1, 3.36], [9, 3.36, 3.62], [10, 3.62, 3.92], [11, 4.22, 4.3], [12, 4.3, 4.56], [13, 4.56, 4.76], [14, 4.76, 5.16], [15, 5.6, 5.8], [16, 5.8, 5.92], [17, 5.92, 6.32], [18, 6.32, 6.52], [19, 6.52, 6.78], [20, 6.78, 6.96], [21, 6.96, 7.32], [22, 7.32, 7.58], [25, 8.12, 8.42], [26, 8.42, 8.56], [27, 8.56, 8.78], [28, 8.78, 9.34]]}, {"text": "Since its launch 3 months ago, it has found over 350 job postings and gets on average 100 hits per day with a list of 60 subscribers.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ec50cc28eed5c418dc295cf14e5e3bc27cdc47ab6d5917edb2ada718b270b6ac.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.48], [4, 0.88, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.4], [6, 1.64, 1.68], [8, 1.8, 1.96], [9, 1.96, 2.22], [10, 2.22, 2.86], [11, 2.86, 3.24], [12, 3.24, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.26], [14, 4.26, 4.44], [15, 4.44, 4.6], [16, 4.6, 4.88], [17, 4.88, 5.36], [18, 5.36, 5.64], [19, 5.64, 5.8], [20, 5.8, 6.02], [21, 6.02, 6.5], [22, 6.5, 6.6], [23, 6.6, 6.78], [24, 6.78, 6.92], [25, 6.92, 7.22], [26, 7.22, 7.7]]}, {"text": "If you are looking for a job in Atlanta’s startup community, Atlanta Startup Jobs is the place to start.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f1ebff3afe7ecc65b9ccb80d4bfa3afa2821e7e26f87ab6ba37d8bfa7598ffc9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.06], [6, 1.06, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.44], [8, 1.44, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.86], [11, 3.22, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 4.04], [13, 4.04, 4.46], [14, 4.46, 4.56], [15, 4.56, 4.7], [16, 4.7, 4.9], [17, 4.9, 5.08], [18, 5.08, 5.38]]}]}